{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 585,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f05630a643e95e16cf6494af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，不论是舞蹈、歌唱还是粉丝互动都～\\n准备万全啰♪啊，你是问竞赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "193c6e63672d3a00fef1f9453d75c267201d4a48b39755f1f890d4c647512be4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fea7e4deae4becc58db23b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱演唱会歌曲就自然而然能放松啰☆\\n大力推荐这么做喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f417c3812bd5dcacac5535bc0e3e7a18ea40c68b3cb90f545c84b7c7a1d12962",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb6e5105cb1f615a1f24787",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃了水果三明治喔☆毕竟参加竞赛\\n需要能量，得吃甜的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e96b68a7a05e85433016f8d72b10e795cb613bf8ebecb4e40febd66f9e078ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b87cdf7f97046cee2d847a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太好了，连我也能接受正式的采访……\\n啊，没事，那个，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c51bdb2535879a961abfda51fbae78dbeb8eb331970bb542b6c30cb9f3aada",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f6212c64af9fbe21966a65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会带给大家最棒的娱乐表演，\\n抱持期待好好看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc7205c1fecb490981b4f0b2937314c9b566d153edd055c7b074aecde5e5956",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ea6d383e8251d8262fd743",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，我很喜欢看书。\\n但比赛的发展我却完全猜不透呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd64bee890b2d7eb67d3b91feed5301c65b332c45f387728dd2851679e3daba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09213de9dbbf47459e2bab95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冒险故事。这次的比赛会成为怎样的冒险……\\n那个、我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e086324082453d9f37e2b56eb6d0dde330b3848fd6fac57fd6fe4d0ae58b79ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7111fcb28eae41d1d14810ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我哪会去想那种事情啊？\\n反正，只要去做姑且就会赢吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8226295d1f76e136600586bf8c33e95e60463aca7a4bb64e56d3c224998758da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:244be53989c2bb94579b83fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如何？好看吧！话说我今天被超多人盯着看，\\n大概是因为弄得比平时还漂亮吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6a446b3092a3a8515ba5ea2bed79b0387f46c0aa927aedf589749c8d2b93501",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae12fd9fa61ba6b86645c64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要喝运动饮料。\\n名字叫开……开特……是什么来着啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2699026ff8abcc608d8e35e6e16beb26b65ed73fbc575aa9b55fccff2cd887",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d97d4bf0b7a83b2c21abcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道。\\n──所以才让人热血沸腾吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef91a32cc1e2b8d28639759583108f27f8a39ff3fb76cadb670e971c13ad2c8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c8649503d9f5d403cc4c54b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在第三弯道附近展开攻势……应该吧。\\n所以呢，你信吗？还是说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1bfad7a66a4393189083a44f33275f6dbd1ba30a68372655af8c774c594aba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237302441e74b395df3c602f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待喔……\\n一起享受极限对战的乐趣吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2a9f5aef0b00c01fb763494e64580e5cff0815cc0f33268f604ff98749a314",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14895d54d7e6868f3264f7dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔……谢谢。你真是个怪人耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "151be11ec470acab03a2c729f18c2a18a02274649923239275bfe62ae1203f0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cc547ef1b357790385395a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也没有说很擅长啦……只是\\n有空的时候会玩……顶多这样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc865a5849b2e590c4667a9de955e896fdc54b27866c896870a38672cf62c8a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33398083dbb019532a86d0c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有部叫「白鞋小步舞曲」的音乐剧非常优秀。\\n芭蕾舞的魅力让人着迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911d7e4ed1c538af381ae9b18b202860c452540e9dd97cb0b3072433ef6603cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaeaf39069f1f38469287edb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……不就是不认为自己很强吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab51380cc7f09568399b89c691f208e5f1047bf55a2f375c229fc045dba9de08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2eaaba7d2f0b913f7990bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好、好的……！我虽然还只是小小的花蕾，\\n但会努力让自己漂亮地盛开的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3961228ebb4bde1bb7a496ac0b23b5ac84f5009feacbb63943ff56eaea15216f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97bdc73ccd3d8313356b3fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然跟其他人相比还不是那么可靠，\\n不过希望大家可以在一旁见证我的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9e1e8c2d00362a647839c7412e0eadc491212b6af554032d6ee443cbd7b477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71689a59b2f1306ca87a5867",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～是马铃薯炖肉和蛋包饭。\\n我可以只用平底锅就把蛋皮漂亮地卷起来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4739d4ef3a5f9e3ad0d716d0e7bb14e22273d0ae3798343b916f61a15806a496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d170238b7ccde80ea9087b3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是什么！？在哪里可以吃到！？\\n我想吃看看致胜料理──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44565b2beea7c6263a7ae5673605fc0cf8e88eb191ebc269658e6decccff4b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7011db19de47919062551b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛不是「庙」喔！\\n它让人既兴奋又非常开心──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc2b1884909252ceef98aa7152701d1fc5c26625c8fabd3e7a3dc08b018af700",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba06163c2d844178385ef95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了很多喔！其中最有趣的，我想想──\\n跟米米做人力手推车体操！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8936686ace56503c0165ed6cf0030f14f989bd98293949990b554fc1f667789a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc5cbbd4337bef5271917e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "堂堂正正一决胜负吧！\\n请多指教！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c353ac23d3e9b0470d86a6cc65effaf13afa1c44e988b2f3ced1114984183597",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab42662b187d898a75da43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "魔鬼应该是参考传说故事的吧。咦？不过\\n故事中的魔鬼，好像都是被讨伐的一方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b20d99fd1e2bbf17ce31fbb2364ec2ae1ff73401871a9f32132098e570ee088b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ddbe2ea9f5d958111b87b0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是我父亲。今天的比赛他一定也会看，\\n所以我绝对不能输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "667f6fe50b3cf10295e3950676770e6827b26ebe2aea8bffb307243c7cb18b57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba63905d0ce25e57b92a7ba3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "留心的事情……好好睡，好好吃，\\n以及好好地吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f62415c9df40ca59256591b60e655b494753b4f87834472162dfca7daed6eca8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21dbeab3808c8ba0f056793",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "とうっ！　ヒーロー見参！　愛と平和と\\nにんじんのため、ビコーペガサス出走だ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "411277315c512fcd10ad0653749f41ea2c9f6e02794d9dcca04ef02e85e47f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7fa2618ce0e6870f7dd22d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もちろん、キャロットマンだ！　いつだって\\nカッコいい、憧れのヒーローだぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d647aca9e52a815adcc0349f6325dd445e7b3474c43820e84cee47011ae473",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b140538b8fa4054e2fa022",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、誰よりも速くゴールに駆けつける。\\nそれがヒーローの役目だからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a47038336361baecdc40358730cefb566bbc25eaba15837c005e9b3d2f8578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2768f7ef3c1fec4272c3017d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯！我有确实减少补充水分了！\\n状态非常好哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "600a5557e0abe17f273408684620e4d58853b70a04c55633fceff4ef9d490a38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d030796a9d83c1503c9ccb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在！与你的相遇，\\n就是一场美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9446398009cb58f46cc762ca4c4f8fd5a5e6f450755a9e5c2aeda48a7fbd730",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073dc49b44414e8b7b092261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是你还是我都很美丽☆\\n让我们跑出美丽的比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb8689a31a4e3f7c59bc01674cf613877abc861eca5b158bbb5a9c68b23d0ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df66b5acad9914108131da6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然！大、大、大、大、大、大……\\n大可放心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1784e2e2d0bc870fb5efef288a2c71e63fef7d3ca1a43abf5b1d443799264852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a119b94348988ff6be2d41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔……看到了！\\n如果我赢的话就是大吉！交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4a66e30a3ea205f287848942b8faf1b43058a85dc5269447f8c62cb9b3f1f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e3a33a341f354975e8100d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会降临吗？不，是确定会降临！因为我睡觉前\\n有拍3下枕头并默念「Shiraoki大人」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d48c1ad44483af1115bca0db35e60d0a549a43026bac039bb979ede6bdfb87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8450f1ddc95cd4e329a23b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会争取胜利，但不会让自己抱着\\n非赢不可的压力。总之，看着我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee49907c7ab2e255ca692e9b111244e445d7794768477dd3c4d50c891b235927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:111f01b14ef72d57c773dd59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……路变得像迷宫一样，偶尔会感到困扰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2465bc6e8ff5fcbacf27378d6cbe16d3bc48aa17dc2cd5b1db4e66966b64336a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998f9da9a97d36e8a057ad76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很令人兴奋对吧！但不论对手是谁，\\n我都只会照自己喜欢的方式去跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f427b7893c1c77256c836a5ea804ecf1503486429d9d60c6e33d3b31bab5cf5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3e291bcfa2e62efe21059a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在散步时我看见了颠倒的彩虹。\\n或许今天的比赛也会变得很有趣哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fc61ce19e707e22d2f2bb358f5772fe509f7050da597fd7ab901b1bc54a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5585e8b88c7f467fe4bdb357",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对、对不起。因为太紧张，所以\\n脸色有点苍白……我、我会加油的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf555db34615d240c4e6923151673a82593efc2c6db754017b5c9f58cc9c05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe08a90335aa9ea2012a9b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个，从我的嘴里\\n说出好歌剧的名字……真的可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "433d0145464536da872854248e24f68f2b56f8576095b8dee7face45aeee4f6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef60f348e049eee241166cc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是无论发生什么事都要跑到最后……\\n对、对不起，我一副很了不起的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "576c8892ffa594624404afbc8c5e1d4537055917ce954b2fc8f5630d3f4a74d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4066e7f7358605b1ebcc4f2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是熏衣草的香氛。\\n可以缓和我的紧张情绪，所以才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "186a6483f0cbe7e6d9ba3c125d361e3adcbdca10f203dd6c6c56207c1f8da29f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03f18378761a1eb722b265f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦……为什么会知道……\\n爸爸真是的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3addf15a6be22b628ffd9793375d47444c2b23dd573c2ddfdfa9a7d72c0ee75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b334bc01a9db47c678a42a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我说的话根本……不过……好吧。\\n我会加油不让大家失望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa098f4d5cc77c1d6457cee4eb6f40d46e99cff0885f6075e3081e1a30ba6ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafddb00b73566d36c5397c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为最近网络上的广告影片也很有看头……\\n等我把东西放进购物车后才清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7d88ca05137a280254045a4bf562ac45de1e4d3509e6fac04313adc09c2149",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aaa7d43c95e0a4ee8ba1310",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会非常打拼，请多指教咧～！\\n……呃，为什么是福冈腔！？（笑）",
      "source_fingerprint": "132877ebbbf34ab0705c1bdacea0e77fdce2928de2ba4e9a7fb166acb049ea93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157011b29bc6e23e84d6ad0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是向故乡──（咕噜噜噜～）\\n……首先要先吃饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2976f491c4099212e57f2defbe07cb29158eeed7f7ef86fb23da69322ad885b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2937b248f36fda5c8139c07b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。用纵横赛场的表现登上综合情报节目。\\n哈哈……刚、刚才的还是剪掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36fa10beecf76cccdaa166c08e029371d3819a1737a971cd0f23cff41e876881",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c047dc6b51226125bc6740b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帝王奔驰不但练习距离比任何人都长，而且还\\n兼顾质量！好好期待正式竞赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7b225bc347964f72ecb9368eab0474a280d8be71c15a5259f9a7b105e4f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfcdc08704619e862620c53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为天空推荐的教科书，白白浪费了时间！\\n猫猫威能是什么啦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b9d9ab72ef6087d520aae05dda3d85db22c9a3c196477215dee424b779ae46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998dbf2173a44c6c9b354bda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通常会出门逛街买东西。不用邮购，\\n因为我要用自己的眼睛看穿哪些才是一流的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76117cdd31a9ef1591cb39cf05c5d9a25d644baac6a359d30ef1d4c1fd8cfa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bfd4f024ba00ca1df731b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在成为日本第一的赛马娘之前，绝对\\n不会停下脚步！我会努力加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ccbd1dea502a366daa1a608edc3e9adfe1308ff184b4b129f69e15f8ff3b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b039a22486d1b0d01e19383a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝卜汉堡排、意大利面还有蛋包饭！\\n咦，这样哪个才算是致胜料理……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd6faa64ee481a647c8d41dbe46dcbc135917863558fe013b40964b4f91006f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7411e2246b85e50811a95f82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个～内侧赛道……呃！\\n这个不能说出来～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "090559ceadb406f351e97461ba923bdcfc3c64990daad0c3ea8909dafb39712f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78cbc948b6b3c3aacdfdbddb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有开始阅读。\\n不过训练理论真的很难懂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6f5b64987f7ff67f58efeeed1b51da399d7a51d67b625b874c9b7170b509cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:137e02df818ef90fc3825293",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……跑到室友惊呼\\n「怎么还在跑！」的程度……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b7d3058e5727491730f9c1e248354a42f6f994469d5a0e03e04d94f0ed97a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc13aa87e26bb342ad874b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑后就听不见周围的声音……但抵达终点后\\n听见的欢呼声让人很畅快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1935afd9dd45087ec3ae4f624f99217ecde4dd43bbd331076816f4feffff3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df91edcc508c8077694b7604",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只想对一出生就离别的妹妹伊势龙虾说\\n……用黑潮是煮不出红味噌汤的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c524a63cb8d85072a50523518d742e05ddd2eba7b844dfdc3db12ed9e7d1b69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8477b7fc31982fffc4f1eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不用说当然有啊♪\\n毕竟我可是最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5fe93bbb1b4f029108794728741b06f1dce17b22bc883ecf10242fab7eece92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04feef0fb9127c9870e2cd0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿──♪大家可以期待喔──！\\n会让你们看到利落的动作！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1c2f6b6a9c57183ec1b4c986beb85a4a6dfc57798ebafebca5880c4a3cf8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac55efe610909c79977d450",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那～当然！蜂蜜特饮真的很好喝，\\n大家也喝看看吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adde6fc924217ef460aed677a61eb1481d32b25de26225113503e0d0a7a2e4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc56bac60beaf408ec0239c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放学后要尽情享受的这件事吧！\\n我星期五晚上会好好狂欢提振精神喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f5262ef4298f22770a18d33ff8e2ff1be5f1029fc6d6831a2e28c1fff9ce39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9e2b569bf92804684d4ab6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全～没问题的啦！啊……\\n还是用状态超赞好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "681e6ae5f424f0bc4772a881947ab6eb997c9cd231d41bda02a62a491799529c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb132478bc972b934f71e3b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "引擎全开全力冲刺……\\n就像「超跑」一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "794b525760a6fb4f03d25cc954e83b641e2ce316e4b857e431454863e5d34f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a51dfccf082f8bf021df145",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小栗前辈在睡着的情况下，把电子锅里的东西\\n全都吃光了呢。那光景让我很惊讶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "371f36b2ca83814cab9051d89b67a02c0cc625cf4775e6aaf6bd6194d2229dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93fc0213f936553ed7630ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会带给大家最棒的娱乐表演，\\n抱持期待好好看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc7205c1fecb490981b4f0b2937314c9b566d153edd055c7b074aecde5e5956",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39fd119a97dec9a66b77f894",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有部叫「白鞋小步舞曲」的音乐剧非常优秀。\\n芭蕾舞的魅力让人着迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911d7e4ed1c538af381ae9b18b202860c452540e9dd97cb0b3072433ef6603cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c63b4391220e897b678ac9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "留心的事情……好好睡，好好吃，\\n以及好好地吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f62415c9df40ca59256591b60e655b494753b4f87834472162dfca7daed6eca8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03df3eb22b8178623f94a2a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝卜汉堡排、意大利面还有蛋包饭！\\n咦，这样哪个才算是致胜料理……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd6faa64ee481a647c8d41dbe46dcbc135917863558fe013b40964b4f91006f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a92ff3cb560398dae68f40a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据产地区分牡蛎，让心情平静下来。\\n这就是阿船大人的正义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fa8254cee9352727ec95646304920ede2bda064735967eec66d4c7f679e7b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004c2aac1232e5f803d4e5bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……路变得像迷宫一样，偶尔会感到困扰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2465bc6e8ff5fcbacf27378d6cbe16d3bc48aa17dc2cd5b1db4e66966b64336a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e963b73de34522f18ba24f0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是向故乡──（咕噜噜噜～）\\n……首先要先吃饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2976f491c4099212e57f2defbe07cb29158eeed7f7ef86fb23da69322ad885b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76ae47d551f485647a51a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只想对一出生就离别的妹妹伊势龙虾说\\n……用黑潮是煮不出红味噌汤的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c524a63cb8d85072a50523518d742e05ddd2eba7b844dfdc3db12ed9e7d1b69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22563429f4423ff4db76b121",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据产地区分牡蛎，让心情平静下来。\\n这就是阿船大人的正义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fa8254cee9352727ec95646304920ede2bda064735967eec66d4c7f679e7b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b6f5f92327a47bb8f7723a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当我用自己设计的非还原型水泥替自己翻模，\\n脖子以下都被固定时，真的以为自己会死。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee103fef1b142d4c0f04abe9e099308810fefa8bc0cb986f61f82867068e9a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdd1d1dfe57b6186ba38ee2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵，就好好期待吧……\\n欸，我这样说是不是很帅气啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "832895f408ad1bfb78c26323d63123b68fb50c34651781a6e9a78d97ce25145b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c0f302f80b9fd665b0230d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这点不予回应……哇赛～～！\\n我一直很想这样讲看看耶！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bac11309b26ea7c746e77b9d0558ce62d05bcc06fae60f12941e09e0d2c1aa6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c88eabbc7b36456c95841c11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿，若说绝不想输的对象倒是有！\\n不过我会以大差的身距甩开对方获胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d501497908498cd76cc9f5eddf3213cd11eedde30dbd51be51912296e9cf027c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "207"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
